#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:90
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"just writing you to let you know that your Call for Participation is now\n"
"closed. Here is a list of links that should be useful in the next days:\n"
"\n"
"- You’ll find a list of all your {submission_count} proposals here:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- You can add reviewers here:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- You can review proposals here:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- And create your schedule here, once you have accepted proposals:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"
msgstr ""
"Hallo,\n"
"\n"
"We laten je hierbij weten dat de Call for Participation nu gesloten is.\n"
"Hier is een lijst met links die nuttig zijn voor de komende dagen:\n"
"\n"
"- De lijst met alle  {submission_count} voorstellen vind je hier:\n"
"  {event_submissions}\n"
"- Je kunt recencenten hier toevoegen:\n"
"  {event_team}\n"
"- Je kan voorstellen hier recenceren:\n"
"  {event_review}\n"
"- En hier maak je het programma als je voorstellen geaccepteerd hebt:\n"
"  {event_schedule}\n"

#: eventyay/base/models/settings.py:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi,\n"
"\n"
"congratulations, your event is over! Hopefully it went well. Here are some\n"
"statistics you might find interesting:\n"
"\n"
"- You had {submission_count} proposals,\n"
"- Of which you selected {talk_count} sessions.\n"
"- The reviewers wrote {review_count} reviews.\n"
"- You released {schedule_count} schedules in total.\n"
"- Over the course of the event, you sent {mail_count} mails.\n"
"\n"
"If there is anything you’re missing, please contact us via our website on "
"eventyay.com.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hallo,\n"
"\n"
"gefeliciteerd, je evenement is voorbij! Hopelijk is alles goed verlopen. "
"Hier zijn enkele statistieken die je misschien interessant vindt:\n"
"\n"
"- Je had {submission_count} voorstellen,\n"
"- Waarvan je {talk_count} sessies hebt geselecteerd.\n"
"- De reviewers schreven {review_count} reviews.\n"
"- Je hebt in totaal {schedule_count} roosters gepubliceerd.\n"
"- Tijdens het evenement heb je {mail_count} e-mails verzonden.\n"
"\n"
"Als je iets mist, neem dan contact met ons op via onze website op "
"eventyay.com.\n"

