"pagina:\n"
"{submission_url}.\n"
"\n"
"Mocht je nog vragen hebben, voel je vrij om contact met ons op te nemen!\n"
"\n"
"De {event_name} organisatie"

#: eventyay/mail/default_templates.py:23
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Hi!\n"
"\n"
"We are happy to tell you that we accept your proposal \"{submission_title}"
"\"\n"
